This template is used to show that a template uses [[w:Lua (programming language)|Lua]] modules. It is placed at the top of the template's <code>/doc</code> subpage. It automatically adds the template to [[:Category:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|default_category}}]], or to one of its subcategories.

== Usage ==

; Basic : {{tlx|Lua|''module name''}}

; All parameters : {{tlx|Lua|''module 1''|''module 2''|''module 3''|...|category{{=}}''custom category''|nocat{{=}}''true''}}

The first module name is required.

== Examples ==

* {{tlx|Lua|Module:Bananas}}
{{Lua|Module:Bananas|nocat=true}}
{{clear}}

* {{tlx|Lua|Module:Bananas|Module:BananasArgs}}
{{Lua|Module:Bananas|Module:BananasArgs|nocat=true}}
{{clear}}

* {{tlx|Lua|Module:Bananas|Module:BananasArgs|Module:HelloWorld}}
{{Lua|Module:Bananas|Module:BananasArgs|Module:HelloWorld|nocat=true}}
{{clear}}

* {{tlx|Lua|wish{{=}}true}}
{{Lua|wish=true|nocat=true}}
{{-}}

* {{tlx|Lua}}
{{Lua|nocat=true}}
{{clear}}

== Categorisation ==

===Template category===
This template adds pages to [[:Category:Lua-based templates]] if the page is in the template namespace, and it is not on any of the subpages /doc, /sandbox, /sandbox2 or /testcases. You can specify a different category with the {{para|category}} parameter, e.g. {{para|category|Lua String-based templates}}.

Some modules have a default category other than [[:Category:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|default_category}}]]:
* [[Module:String]] has the default category [[:Category:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|module_categories|String}}]].

===Error category===
If no modules are specified and wishes are not enabled by default, the transcluded page will be added to [[:Category:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|error_category}}]].
{{#if:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|wish_category}}|<nowiki/>
=== Wish category ===
If no modules are specified {{#if:{{yesno|{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|allow_wishes}}}}|or|and}} {{para|wish|true}} is used, the page will be added to [[:Category:{{#invoke:Data|Module:Lua banner/config|wish_category}}]]
<nowiki/>}}
===Category suppression===
To suppress all categorisation, use {{para|nocat|true}}. (As well as "true", the values "yes", "y", and "1" will also work.)

